  "name": "Summon Aberration",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Champions Guild Automation:</em> Pick the form when you cast: an aberrant spirit: Beholderkin, Mind Flayer or Slaad. The spirit appears within 90 ft, is an ally, shares your initiative (acting right after you) and obeys your commands; it Dodges if you give none. Its AC, Hit Points and damage grow with the slot level, and its attacks and save DCs use your spell attack bonus and spell save DC. It disappears at 0 Hit Points or when your concentration ends.</p>",
